{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12794","headline":"别李明府 · 韩翃","name":"别李明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宠光五世要青组，出入珠宫引箫鼓。\n醉舞雄王玳瑁牀，娇嘶骏马珊瑚柱。\n胡儿夹鼓越婢随，行捧玉盘尝荔枝。\n罗山道士请人送，林邑使臣调象骑。\n爱君一身游上国，阙下名公如旧识。\n万里初怀印绶归，湘江过尽岭花飞。\n五侯焦石烹江笋，千户沈香染客衣。\n别後想君难可见，苍梧云里空山县。\n汗苑芳菲入夏阑，待君障日蒲葵扇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}